            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> By coincidence, you reported this in #24613. I plan to fix it first, and update doc with that fix. For now, this PR has only the news.txt entry. What do you think?\r\n\r\nAll these cases usually come as a result of testing edge cases and infrequent use cases. Both #24613 and #42321 comment are result of that. I think making built-in operator behavior consistently with `g@` with the least amount of breaking changes possible is a reasonable direction here.",
